nt wrapper pb-6 sm:pb-16\" data-astro-cid-qo5xhe7c> <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"TVSeries\",\"name\":\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End\",\"url\":\"https://subdl.com/subtitle/sd1667204/frieren-beyond-journeys-end\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"alternateName\":[\"Sōsō no Furīren\",\"Sousou no Frieren\"],\"image\":\"https://poster.subdl.com/poster/dqZENchTd7lp5zht7BdlqM7RBhD.jpg\",\"description\":\"After the party of heroes defeated the Demon King, they restored peace to the land and returned to lives of solitude. Generations pass, and the elven mage Frieren comes face to face with humanity's mortality. She takes on a new apprentice and promises to fulfill old friends' dying wishes. Can an elven mind make peace with the nature of life and death? Frieren embarks on her quest to find out.\",\"genre\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Action \\u0026 Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi \\u0026 Fantasy\"],\"datePublished\":\"2023-09-29\",\"numberOfSeasons\":1},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Subdl\",\"item\":\"https://subdl.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End (2023)\",\"item\":\"https://subdl.com/subtitle/sd1667204/frieren-beyond-journeys-end\"}]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many seasons of Frieren: Beyond Journey's End have subtitles on SUBDL?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"SUBDL lists 3 seasons of Frieren: Beyond Journey's End: Specials, Season 1, Season 2. Open a season to see its subtitles grouped by language and episode.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I download Frieren: Beyond Journey's End subtitles?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Choose a season of Frieren: Beyond Journey's End below, then pick your language. Every subtitle row names the release it was made for and downloads as a free SRT file, no account required.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"mx-auto md:pl-10 md:pr-10\"><div class=\"min-h-[150px]\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:100;margin-top:var(--page-header-overlap,-150px);\"><div class=\"mx-auto mt-5 sm:mt-10\"> <div class=\"relative flex gap-3 flex-col lg:flex-row md:flex-row items-center lg:items-start md:items-start\"> <a href=\"/subtitle/sd1667204/frieren-beyond-journeys-end\" aria-label=\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End\"> <div class=\"select-none flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width:120px;height:180px;box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:0px;\"> <img alt=\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End\" title=\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End\" class=\"object-cover rounded-md\" src=\"https://poster.subdl.com/poster/dqZENchTd7lp5zht7BdlqM7RBhD.jpg\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"180\" style=\"width:120px;height:180px;\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://subdl.com/images/poster.jpeg'\"> </div> </a> <div class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 flex-grow flex-col items-center md:h-[180px] md:items-start md:pb-[15px]\"> <div class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col items-center lg:items-start md:items-start\">   <h1 class=\"text-balance break-words text-xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-2xl\" style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;\">Frieren: Beyond Journey&#39;s End (Sōsō no Furīren, 2023)</h1> <p class=\"mt-1 line-clamp-2 max-w-[90ch] break-words text-sm text-text3\"> Also known as: Sousou no Frieren </p>  <div class=\"mt-2 min-h-[24px]\"> <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\"> <ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 break-words text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:gap-2.5\"> <li class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"> <a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/subtitle/sd1667204/frieren-beyond-journeys-end\"> TV Show Home </a> </li>  </ol> </nav> </div> </div> <astro-island uid=\"Z1oXckP\" prefix=\"r13\" component-url=\"/_