d</button></a><div class=\"relative inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 py-2 h-9 rounded-l-none border-l border-background/40 bg-secondary/75 px-2 text-secondary-foreground shadow-sm hover:bg-secondary\" aria-label=\"Upload options\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"relative inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-input bg-background shadow-sm hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground py-2 h-9 px-3\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"More tools\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ellipsis h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg></button></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> <section class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-secondary/40 p-4\"> <h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-text2\"> Storyline  — Frieren: Beyond Journey&#39;s End (2023) </h2> <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"> <div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Animation</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Drama</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Action &amp; Adventure</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Sci-Fi &amp; Fantasy</div> <span class=\"break-words max-w-full sm:whitespace-nowrap\">Released: 2023-09-29</span>  </div> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text2 line-clamp-4 md:line-clamp-none\"> After the party of heroes defeated the Demon King, they restored peace to the land and returned to lives of solitude. Generations pass, and the elven mage Frieren comes face to face with humanity&#39;s mortality. She takes on a new apprentice and promises to fulfill old friends&#39; dying wishes. Can an elven mind make peace with the nature of life and death? Frieren embarks on her quest to find out. </p> </section> <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-4\"> <a href=\"/subtitle/sd1667204/frieren-beyond-journeys-end/specials-season\"> <div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center select-none rounded-md bg-secondary hover:bg-text5 hover:shadow-md overflow-hidden h-[100px] transition-all\"> <div style=\"width:50px;height:75px;transform:rotate(-13deg) scale(1.5,1.5);margin-left:-10px;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-image:url(https://poster.subdl.com/poster/fazbwo9OYXhhHCrRfwPU3Eup4iL.jpg);\"></div> <div class=\"f