><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Drama</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Action &amp; Adventure</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground font-normal\">Sci-Fi &amp; Fantasy</div> <span class=\"break-words max-w-full sm:whitespace-nowrap\">Released: 2023-09-29</span>  </div> <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text2 line-clamp-4 md:line-clamp-none\"> After the party of heroes defeated the Demon King, they restored peace to the land and returned to lives of solitude. Generations pass, and the elven mage Frieren comes face to face with humanity&#39;s mortality. She takes on a new apprentice and promises to fulfill old friends&#39; dying wishes. Can an elven mind make peace with the nature of life and death? Frieren embarks on her quest to find out. </p> </section>  </div><p class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-sm text-text3\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-text2\">Latest episode: 10</span><span>10 episodes available</span><span>Last updated <time datetime=\"2026-10-26T05:44:10.000Z\">Oct 26, 2026</time></span></p></div><script type=\"module\">const l=\"sdl_pc_paid\",b=\"sdl_pc_hide_until\";const p=(t,e)=>{const n=window.gtag;typeof n==\"function\"&&n(\"event\",t,{card_id:e.dataset.pcShown,card_slot:e.dataset.pcSlot,forced:e.hasAttribute(\"data-pc-forced\")})},f=t=>{try{return localStorage.getItem(t)}catch{return null}},u=(t,e)=>{try{e===null?localStorage.removeItem(t):localStorage.setItem(t,e)}catch{}},s=t=>[...document.querySelectorAll(`[${t}]`)],S=t=>document.querySelect